WEBVTT

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:23.050
Before I knew it, I abandoned happiness to survive

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:30.190
Lying to myself, I danced clinging on to illusions

00:00:30.970 --> 00:00:36.850
At the edge of my vision when I close my eyes

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:42.840
I was searching for your smile

00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:50.210
With our memories fading

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:57.290
We hold on to our dreams and run  Yeah

00:00:57.620 --> 00:01:04.190
These feelings that I shut away in my heart

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:11.420
I'll now grasp them again

00:01:31.370 --> 00:01:36.350
Amelda foolishly hijacked my plane for a rematch.

00:01:36.350 --> 00:01:41.480
If you dare stand in my way, I'll mow you down!

00:01:41.480 --> 00:01:44.380
Fine.  I accept this duel.

00:01:44.380 --> 00:01:49.890
But he shows me illusions to try to faze me.

00:01:49.890 --> 00:01:51.560
It won't work, Amelda.

00:01:51.560 --> 00:01:54.790
You really think that'll work on me?

00:01:55.190 --> 00:02:01.200
Air Fortress Ziggurat

00:02:11.520 --> 00:02:13.360
Anyone!  Answer!

00:02:14.320 --> 00:02:16.250
Hello.  This is Isono.

00:02:16.250 --> 00:02:17.450
Isono!

00:02:17.450 --> 00:02:19.930
No time to explain!

00:02:19.930 --> 00:02:21.620
The plane is going down!

00:02:23.280 --> 00:02:26.090
Tell me how to fly this thing!

00:02:26.090 --> 00:02:27.940
Just one moment.

00:02:27.940 --> 00:02:28.840
Here.

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:41.410
Kaiba, I'll show you my special card.

00:02:41.410 --> 00:02:44.380
I activate my spell card, Junk Dealer!

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:49.480
I can Special Summon up to two Machine or Warrior monsters from my graveyard...

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:52.320
...by halving their attack points.

00:02:52.560 --> 00:02:54.250
Resurrect!

00:02:54.460 --> 00:02:56.150
Science Soldier!

00:02:56.150 --> 00:02:58.120
Cyber Soldier of Darkworld!

00:02:59.550 --> 00:03:03.430
Then I summon Kinetic Soldier from my hand!

00:03:05.060 --> 00:03:08.730
Due to Orichalcos's effect, their attack points increase!

00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:19.040
The panel left of the control stick.

00:03:19.040 --> 00:03:22.980
Level with the horizon... done!

00:03:22.980 --> 00:03:25.400
Pull back on the lever!

00:03:26.300 --> 00:03:27.920
Send all jet helicopters!

00:03:28.180 --> 00:03:31.620
Save Mr. Seto and Mr. Mokuba!

00:03:32.200 --> 00:03:34.200
I activate my trap card!

00:03:34.200 --> 00:03:35.790
Soldier Revolt!

00:03:36.100 --> 00:03:43.230
I can only activated it when Science Soldier, Kinetic Soldier and Cyber Soldier of Darkworld are on my field.

00:03:43.630 --> 00:03:46.800
I can't conduct my Battle Phase this turn.

00:03:46.800 --> 00:03:49.650
But I can send your entire hand to the graveyard.

00:03:49.650 --> 00:03:52.610
And destroy every card on your field.

00:04:03.080 --> 00:04:08.290
From my hand, I activate the spell card, Sky Union.

00:04:09.540 --> 00:04:12.660
I tribute three monsters on my field.

00:04:18.960 --> 00:04:22.800
I summon Air Fortress Ziggurat!

00:04:34.880 --> 00:04:37.150
What is that?

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:44.960
Please!

00:04:58.210 --> 00:05:01.210
Switching to autopilot.

00:05:01.800 --> 00:05:02.880
Great!

00:05:03.420 --> 00:05:05.420
Big brother!  I did it!

00:05:07.040 --> 00:05:08.090
Big brother...

00:05:23.930 --> 00:05:26.870
What's this monster?

00:05:27.180 --> 00:05:30.810
It's the perfect monster to end you.

00:05:30.810 --> 00:05:36.000
Your spells and traps can't affect it.

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:41.420
And during my End Phase, it Special Summons a Toy Robot Token.

00:05:43.560 --> 00:05:48.360
You're only allowed to attack this Token!

00:05:51.100 --> 00:05:52.230
No way.

00:05:52.460 --> 00:05:54.160
That monster is...

00:05:54.770 --> 00:05:57.100
This is my special card.

00:05:57.100 --> 00:06:01.540
Kaiba, this monster will exact my revenge.

00:06:01.540 --> 00:06:02.890
Lame.

00:06:02.890 --> 00:06:06.330
Sentimentality doesn't work on me!

00:06:06.330 --> 00:06:07.880
My turn!  I draw!

00:06:08.430 --> 00:06:10.310
Both of you!  Stop!

00:06:10.540 --> 00:06:16.570
Mokuba, we can't fulfill our dream unless I defeat him.

00:06:17.610 --> 00:06:20.490
Our dream...  Kaiba Land.

00:06:20.940 --> 00:06:25.930
I'll crush whoever stands in my way!

00:06:26.740 --> 00:06:29.430
From my hand, I activate Pot of Greed!

00:06:34.350 --> 00:06:36.670
I set a card.

00:06:36.670 --> 00:06:38.260
I end my turn.

00:06:40.100 --> 00:06:43.550
It seems your cards have forsaken you.

00:06:43.760 --> 00:06:48.720
When Ziggurat attack you directly next turn, you lose.

00:06:50.260 --> 00:06:53.480
Kaiba Land?  Don't make me laugh.

00:06:53.480 --> 00:06:59.030
Since Gozaburo raised you, you can't bring joy to others!

00:06:59.030 --> 00:07:03.500
You're wrong!  My brother rejected Gozaburo!

00:07:03.500 --> 00:07:06.700
We dreamed of Kaiba Land before we met Gozaburo-

00:07:06.920 --> 00:07:08.480
Say no more, Mokuba.

00:07:08.480 --> 00:07:10.870
He wouldn't understand.

00:07:11.080 --> 00:07:17.650
That's right.  Just like how you can't understand the hell my brother and I went through.

00:07:17.650 --> 00:07:20.820
But that doesn't matter anymore.

00:07:21.160 --> 00:07:23.340
I'll end you now!

00:07:23.340 --> 00:07:26.270
Your soul will bury the past!

00:07:26.270 --> 00:07:28.620
My turn!  I draw!

00:07:29.230 --> 00:07:33.060
Air Fortress Ziggurat attacks you directly!

00:07:33.440 --> 00:07:36.170
Vanish, Kaiba!

00:07:51.440 --> 00:07:52.620
Big brother!

00:07:52.620 --> 00:07:54.550
I flip over my trap card!

00:07:54.550 --> 00:07:57.020
Traps can't affect Ziggurat!

00:07:57.190 --> 00:07:59.370
Magical Trick Mirror!

00:07:59.370 --> 00:08:03.430
This card activates a spell card in your graveyard!

00:08:03.430 --> 00:08:04.510
What?

00:08:06.140 --> 00:08:08.300
I activate your card!

00:08:08.520 --> 00:08:10.250
Junk Dealer!

00:08:11.020 --> 00:08:13.020
Due to Junk Dealer's effect...

00:08:13.020 --> 00:08:17.640
...I Special Summon Judge Man from my graveyard with half its attack points.

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:34.580
Damn!  He doesn't give up!

00:08:34.580 --> 00:08:36.330
I end my turn!

00:08:45.550 --> 00:08:47.410
Rescue helicopters!

00:08:50.940 --> 00:08:53.610
Mr. Seto!  Mr. Mokuba!

00:08:54.160 --> 00:08:55.310
Isono!

00:09:12.590 --> 00:09:15.330
Kaiba!

00:09:30.460 --> 00:09:32.000
Throw them a rope!

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:34.320
Save Mr. Seto and Mr. Mokuba!

00:09:47.800 --> 00:09:50.230
Mr. Seto!  Mr. Mokuba!

00:09:58.430 --> 00:09:59.270
Big brother!

00:10:02.210 --> 00:10:06.180
Kaiba!  You've exposed your true colors!

00:10:06.800 --> 00:10:10.820
You talk of Kaiba Land when you still have those in your possession?

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:17.580
You may talk a good game, but you're no different than Gozaburo!

00:10:17.580 --> 00:10:19.640
You're a killer!

00:10:19.640 --> 00:10:24.380
You'll never understand someone like me who get killed!

00:10:24.380 --> 00:10:25.700
My turn.

00:10:27.680 --> 00:10:28.540
Big brother...

00:10:28.540 --> 00:10:31.540
I activate a spell card from my hand.

00:10:31.540 --> 00:10:33.780
Soul Exchange!

00:10:33.780 --> 00:10:38.350
We both can tribute a monster on our opponent's field.

00:10:38.560 --> 00:10:40.650
Kaiba!  You!

00:10:40.650 --> 00:10:42.340
The duel isn't over yet.

00:10:42.340 --> 00:10:44.350
Save your complaints for the end.

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:47.000
You're wasting your time.

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:49.520
You can't tribute Ziggurat!

00:10:50.100 --> 00:10:52.800
That weak monster will do!

00:10:53.770 --> 00:10:57.380
Come out, Blue-Eyes White Dragon!

00:11:31.470 --> 00:11:32.970
I end my turn.

00:11:34.270 --> 00:11:38.830
Even if you summon Blue-Eyes now, what can you do?

00:11:38.830 --> 00:11:40.490
I'll end this.

00:11:40.490 --> 00:11:44.410
If I draw a monster card next turn, it's all over!

00:11:44.860 --> 00:11:46.350
"If" you do.

00:11:47.410 --> 00:11:48.280
I draw!

00:11:50.580 --> 00:11:52.960
You're lucky.

00:11:52.960 --> 00:11:55.660
I set a card and end my turn.

00:11:58.590 --> 00:12:04.530
My brother has Blue-Eyes, but it can only attack the Token.

00:12:04.970 --> 00:12:06.970
My turn!  I draw!

00:12:07.360 --> 00:12:11.680
Blue-Eyes White Dragon attacks that weak monster!

00:12:11.680 --> 00:12:14.420
Burst Stream of Destruction!

00:12:20.510 --> 00:12:23.650
I set a card and end my turn.

00:12:24.040 --> 00:12:25.600
My turn.

00:12:26.090 --> 00:12:27.350
I drew it.

00:12:27.350 --> 00:12:30.760
I can now end our fight!

00:12:32.690 --> 00:12:35.400
Mirko, watch this.

00:12:35.400 --> 00:12:38.630
I activate the Quick-Play Spell, Toy Robot Box!

00:12:41.380 --> 00:12:46.910
By discarding a card, I summon three Toy Robot Tokens!

00:12:48.110 --> 00:12:50.620
I tribute a Token!

00:12:52.340 --> 00:12:54.850
To summon Spell Canceller!

00:12:58.660 --> 00:13:02.760
As long as it's on the field, you can't activate a spell card!

00:13:02.760 --> 00:13:06.020
You can no longer do anything, Kaiba!

00:13:06.920 --> 00:13:11.220
Ziggurat will attack Blue-Eyes and destroy each other.

00:13:11.220 --> 00:13:14.640
Then my next direct attack will end you!

00:13:14.640 --> 00:13:20.430
Rejoice!  By sacrificing your soul, this world will be reborn!

00:13:21.120 --> 00:13:23.390
By destroying all mankind?

00:13:23.390 --> 00:13:24.900
Yeah.

00:13:24.900 --> 00:13:25.960
I see.

00:13:27.630 --> 00:13:35.910
Since your brother and parents were killed, you'll kill every parent and brother in the world?

00:13:35.910 --> 00:13:38.800
No.  This is a reset.

00:13:38.800 --> 00:13:41.520
We'll return to zero and start over!

00:13:41.520 --> 00:13:43.330
A peaceful world with no wars!

00:13:43.330 --> 00:13:44.910
Reset?

00:13:45.860 --> 00:13:48.500
Even if your brother was still alive?

00:13:48.880 --> 00:13:49.670
What?

00:13:49.880 --> 00:13:53.840
Would you still reset the world?

00:13:54.320 --> 00:13:55.660
Stop messing around!

00:13:55.660 --> 00:13:58.080
You killed Mirko!  How dare you say that!

00:13:58.080 --> 00:14:02.220
You're wrong.  You couldn't save your brother.

00:14:02.720 --> 00:14:05.390
What are you talking about?

00:14:05.390 --> 00:14:07.000
Don't you get it?

00:14:07.000 --> 00:14:08.730
You couldn't save him.

00:14:08.730 --> 00:14:10.930
That's when you lost.

00:14:11.140 --> 00:14:14.220
And you think you'll reset the world?

00:14:14.220 --> 00:14:16.600
That's loser talk.

00:14:17.640 --> 00:14:22.970
Kaiba, I'll never forgive you!

00:14:23.180 --> 00:14:25.540
Go, Ziggurat!

00:14:33.720 --> 00:14:35.070
Big brother!

00:14:35.300 --> 00:14:38.450
Amelda, If I were you...

00:14:38.450 --> 00:14:42.620
I'd never have let my brother die!

00:14:44.780 --> 00:14:46.740
I activate my trap card!

00:14:46.740 --> 00:14:47.990
Tyrant Wing!

00:14:47.990 --> 00:14:49.160
What?

00:14:54.330 --> 00:14:59.200
The equipped monster gains 400 attack points!

00:14:59.200 --> 00:15:03.540
And it can attack twice during my next Battle Phase!

00:15:06.280 --> 00:15:07.410
Impossible!

00:15:07.410 --> 00:15:10.420
Blue-Eyes White Dragon attacks!

00:15:10.420 --> 00:15:13.590
Burst Stream of Destruction!

00:15:49.660 --> 00:15:53.230
You have no monsters left to defeat me.

00:15:53.440 --> 00:15:59.020
So what?  This plane won't last minutes!

00:15:59.020 --> 00:16:04.340
If nothing changes, we'll both die.

00:16:10.410 --> 00:16:14.080
You're stalling by not declaring the end of your turn?

00:16:14.080 --> 00:16:16.880
You're the one who wanted to end things!

00:16:17.100 --> 00:16:20.720
This is how it'll end for us.

00:16:20.720 --> 00:16:24.790
You came here to die from the start!

00:16:25.120 --> 00:16:26.950
Amelda, stop!

00:16:26.950 --> 00:16:30.300
You're only making your brother sad!

00:16:46.250 --> 00:16:48.980
You truly are a loser.

00:16:50.740 --> 00:16:53.920
You said you would've saved your brother.

00:16:54.140 --> 00:16:57.360
But can you really save him?

00:16:57.730 --> 00:16:58.790
I can.

00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:00.230
Big brother...

00:17:00.620 --> 00:17:05.050
Impossible!  I still have three monsters on my field!

00:17:05.050 --> 00:17:10.170
How can you end this duel and save Mokuba before the plane is destroyed?

00:17:10.380 --> 00:17:12.840
Continue the duel, Amelda!

00:17:14.380 --> 00:17:16.810
I won't let Mokuba die!

00:17:16.810 --> 00:17:20.560
So I'll finish this duel on the next turn!

00:17:20.840 --> 00:17:22.010
Can you?

00:17:23.960 --> 00:17:26.250
Then show me.

00:17:26.250 --> 00:17:27.900
I end my turn.

00:17:30.160 --> 00:17:36.560
Amelda, witness a true duelist's power!  The chosen one's glory!

00:17:37.280 --> 00:17:40.930
I promise to draw that card!

00:17:42.020 --> 00:17:43.000
Big brother...

00:17:43.420 --> 00:17:45.370
My turn!  I draw!

00:17:51.610 --> 00:17:54.180
I activate Fang of Critias from my hand!

00:17:56.150 --> 00:17:59.720
I fuse it with my trap card, Tyrant Wing!

00:18:01.380 --> 00:18:04.950
I Special Summon Tyrant Burst Dragon!

00:18:06.290 --> 00:18:13.230
Tyrant Burst Dragon can damage all your monsters in a single battle!

00:18:13.230 --> 00:18:15.900
And it combines with Blue-Eyes!

00:18:26.420 --> 00:18:30.450
Go!  Tyrant Burst Stream of Destruction!

00:18:45.480 --> 00:18:48.270
Impressive, Kaiba.

00:18:57.160 --> 00:18:58.110
Amelda!

00:19:12.220 --> 00:19:13.500
Mirko.

00:19:21.520 --> 00:19:22.980
Amelda!

00:19:23.680 --> 00:19:24.920
Amelda...

00:19:30.860 --> 00:19:33.140
Mokuba!  You stay here!

00:19:33.140 --> 00:19:33.810
Big brother!

00:19:40.200 --> 00:19:44.190
Amelda, I will keep my promise!

00:19:44.740 --> 00:19:46.620
I won't let Mokuba die!

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:52.500
What?

00:19:54.830 --> 00:19:55.600
What?

00:20:01.690 --> 00:20:02.810
That's...

00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:33.970
Jonouchi!  Honda!

00:20:34.580 --> 00:20:35.580
Yugi!

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:36.410
Anzu!

00:20:38.540 --> 00:20:41.350
That logo...  It's Kaiba's jet!

00:20:42.030 --> 00:20:44.360
Are the passengers okay?

00:20:47.980 --> 00:20:49.150
Kaiba!

00:20:49.650 --> 00:20:50.860
Yugi?

00:20:53.830 --> 00:20:55.130
Everyone!

00:20:59.180 --> 00:21:01.240
He's a Doma.

00:21:01.240 --> 00:21:02.900
You won?

00:21:02.900 --> 00:21:06.840
Of course.  But why are you here?

00:21:06.840 --> 00:21:10.060
Three dragons led us here.

00:21:10.060 --> 00:21:14.280
Kaiba, you are destined to fight alongside us.

00:21:15.500 --> 00:21:20.740
I don't believe in destiny, but you may prove useful.

00:21:21.900 --> 00:21:24.860
Masters Seto and Mokuba!  You're both okay!

00:21:24.860 --> 00:21:25.790
Isono!

00:21:26.000 --> 00:21:29.020
Master Seto, I have bad news!

00:21:35.360 --> 00:21:38.500
We finished buying KaibaCorp.

00:21:57.400 --> 00:22:06.310
The streets flow by, colored in red

00:22:06.810 --> 00:22:14.720
If you notice your pain, it changes to joy

00:22:16.380 --> 00:22:25.810
People learn of friendship every time they wipe their tears

00:22:26.420 --> 00:22:35.330
With the warm strength you gave me, I'll change them into kindness

00:22:35.900 --> 00:22:44.360
My overflowing emotions don't stop

00:22:45.140 --> 00:22:49.870
I'll live feeling them

00:22:50.480 --> 00:22:55.050
For me to be me

00:22:55.050 --> 00:23:03.510
Overflowing friendship heals me

00:23:04.190 --> 00:23:09.150
Our chance meeting was real

00:23:09.670 --> 00:23:18.880
We'll both understand that someday

00:23:24.620 --> 00:23:28.360
Kaiba defeated Amelda, one of Doma's Three Musketeers.

00:23:28.360 --> 00:23:32.380
But in the meantime, Kaiba Corporation fell into Doma's hands.

00:23:32.380 --> 00:23:35.890
And the Florida museum's documents were being stolen.

00:23:35.890 --> 00:23:39.060
To decode the documents we barely retrieved...

00:23:39.060 --> 00:23:43.500
...Yugi and Kaiba head to Kaiba Corporation's central computer roon.

00:23:43.500 --> 00:23:47.330
Be careful!  Doma must be already there!

00:23:47.330 --> 00:23:50.170
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Dartz's Shadow Approaches

00:23:50.170 --> 00:23:51.640
Duel, standby!
